{"channelId":"UCtMhdSIr3SeqHSYfeY3l3uQ","row":["Purr Partners Feline Rescue",16,"Welcome to the official YouTube channel for Purr Partners Feline Rescue, a 501(c)(3) nonprofit dedicated to saving the most at-risk cats and kittens in central North Carolina.\n\nWe focus our mission on those who need us most: felines in high-kill shelters, survivors of hoarding situations, the sick and injured, and fragile bottle babies requiring 24/7 care. By stepping in where the need is greatest, we give a voice to the vulnerable.\n\nWhy Foster-Based?\nAs an all-foster rescue, we don’t have a central building. Instead, our cats live in private homes with dedicated volunteers. This allows every kitty to socialize, rehabilitate, and thrive in a safe, loving environment before finding their forever family.\n\nJoin Our Mission:\n\nAdopt: View our available cats at purrpartners.org.\n\nFoster: Become the bridge between rescue and adoption.\n\nSupport: Your donations fund life-saving medical care.\n\nSubscribe for rescue stories, recovery updates, and plenty of happy endings! 🐾","","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCtMhdSIr3SeqHSYfeY3l3uQ","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCtMhdSIr3SeqHSYfeY3l3uQ","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:11:47.624Z","channelId":"UCtMhdSIr3SeqHSYfeY3l3uQ","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"56e6af1ee5d58c0a6d0ab457cb54e21725624ef0f0830c1e4078667c770bb195","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"dbf6a857d3d73aeedd6ac02a2653adabf2ab63644519418d320407eb16951268"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCtMhdSIr3SeqHSYfeY3l3uQ","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:11:47.624Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCtMhdSIr3SeqHSYfeY3l3uQ","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":16,"raw":"16 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCtMhdSIr3SeqHSYfeY3l3uQ","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:11:47.624Z"}],"ema